{
  "_comment": "What the shared dailies deal. Every date's daily and Daily Quiz is fixed here, so an update never changes a day. 'pool': the prompts the daily may use, hand-picked so a typical IOAI contestant can answer at once (syllabus concepts and well-known names, like 'Name an optimizer'); practice-heavy prompts (RAG, PEFT, quantization formats, special tokens, pandas, sklearn utilities...) stay out and remain in Unlimited, Quiz and live rooms. 'launch': days 1-7, hand-picked, easiest first. 'later': days 8 on, dealt from the pool once by tools/freeze-days.js and then left alone (every pool prompt once before any repeats, none twice within five days). 'quiz': the Daily Quiz's hand-picked days 1-21, seven data/reasoning.json questions each, two easy, two medium, three hard; 'quizLater': days 22 on, dealt the same way. Before launch (LAUNCH_DATE in js/engine.js, or the launch day set in #admin) every day plays day 1; from launch day, day n plays day n. A new prompt reaches the daily only when a day lists it: edit a future day by hand, or append days with node tools/freeze-days.js --days N (it never rewrites a day already here).",
